# 📂 Documentation

## Autodocs
- Every new component must have JSDoc/TSDoc annotations.

## Changelog
- Update `CHANGELOG.md` with every meaningful change.

## Readmes
- Each new utility or feature directory should include a minimal `README.md` explaining its purpose.

## Documentation Completeness
- Documentation should be clear, concise, and up-to-date
- Include examples where helpful
- Document edge cases and known limitations
